{"ticker":"TPL","updated":"2026-10-30T23:17:23Z","profile":{"longName":"Texas Pacific Land Corporation","shortName":"Texas Pacific Land Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","country":"United States","website":"https://www.texaspacific.com","fullTimeEmployees":114,"marketCap":22877521920,"trailingPE":42.30612,"forwardPE":4.5361047,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":25.48911,"pegRatio":7.33,"targetMeanPrice":443.0,"targetHighPrice":639.0,"targetLowPrice":247.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":2,"recommendationKey":"none","revenueGrowth":0.312,"earningsGrowth":0.327,"grossMargins":0.93336,"operatingMargins":0.78177,"profitMargins":0.60322,"totalRevenue":897540992,"beta":0.588,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":547.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":269.23334,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.73},"summary":"Texas Pacific Land Corporation engages in the land and resource management, and water services and operations businesses. The Land and Resource Management segment manages surface acres of land, and oil and gas royalty interest in Permian Basin. This segment also engages in easements, such as transporting oil, gas and related hydrocarbons, power line and utility, and subsurface wellbore easements. In addition, this segment leases its land for processing, storage, and compression facilities and roads; and is involved in sale of materials, such as caliche, sand, and other material, as well as sells land. The Water Services and Operations segment provides full-service water offerings, including water sourcing, produced-water treatment, infrastructure development, and disposal solutions to operators in the Permian Basin. This segment also holds produced water royalties. The company owns a 1/128th nonparticipating perpetual oil and gas royalty interest (NPRI) under approximately 85,000 acres of land; a 1/16th NPRI under approximately 371,000 acres of land; and approximately 33,000 additional net royalty acres, total of approximately 224,000 NRA located in the Permian Basin. The company was founded in 1888 and is headquartered in Dallas, Texas.","summary_zh":"德州太平洋土地公司從事土地和資源管理以及供水服務和營運業務。土地和資源管理部門管理二疊紀盆地的地表面積以及石油和天然氣特許權權益。該部門也從事地役權業務，例如運輸石油、天然氣和相關碳氫化合物、電力線路和公用設施以及地下井眼地役權。此外，該部門還租賃土地用於加工、儲存和壓縮設施以及道路；並參與材料銷售，例如鈣質、沙子和其他材料，以及銷售土地。水服務和營運部門為二疊紀盆地的營運商提供全方位的水務服務，包括取水、採出水處理、基礎設施開發和處置解決方案。該部門也持有採出水特許權使用費。該公司在約 85,000 英畝的土地上擁有 1/128 的非參與永久石油和天然氣特許權權益 (NPRI)； NPRI 的 1/16，佔地約 371,000 英畝；以及約 33,000 英畝的額外淨特許權使用費，位於二疊紀盆地的 NRA 總數約為 24,000 英畝。該公司成立於 1888 年，總部位於德克薩斯州達拉斯。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣勘探與生產","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":310.4133,"h":324.2467,"l":310.4133,"c":314.1067,"v":511500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":311.4467,"h":311.4467,"l":303.1267,"c":303.16,"v":316800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":300.52,"h":309.6433,"l":300.4567,"c":309.6433,"v":270900},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":305.1833,"h":308.3867,"l":296.35,"c":296.3967,"v":413100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":300.8167,"h":305.76,"l":298.58,"c":304.1933,"v":427200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":304.1933,"h":306.9767,"l":299.9667,"c":300.04,"v":322500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":302.7233,"h":312.5467,"l":302.7233,"c":312.5433,"v":278100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":309.4167,"h":313.9867,"l":308.61,"c":312.9967,"v":287100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":315.9267,"h":318.6633,"l":311.2733,"c":312.39,"v":326700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":314.12,"h":318.31,"l":304.4533,"c":307.84,"v":346500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":308.8433,"h":314.7133,"l":308.7933,"c":311.89,"v":328800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":310.1267,"h":314.4433,"l":304.3333,"c":304.3333,"v":450900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":305.2567,"h":310.61,"l":303.94,"c":304.4233,"v":386700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":302.9833,"h":304.12,"l":289.8967,"c":291.7,"v":1280400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":289.4767,"h":295.4,"l":286.6767,"c":292.32,"v":460500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":292.6,"h":312.3333,"l":292.6,"c":310.4267,"v":657600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":315.3367,"h":320.3233,"l":311.4333,"c":311.6667,"v":392100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":311.61,"h":312.2633,"l":306.2433,"c":308.5233,"v":296100},{"t"